{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Ryu's curated tool catalog seed (Treg parity B3). Each entry is one vendor endpoint Ryu serves natively or prices from the vendor's own pages, typed by the capability taxonomy (capability-taxonomy-v1.json) and joined by endpoint id to its price record (tool-price-v1.json). docsUrl is the vendor's own API reference, checked on docsCheckedOn. operation is the vendor method and path template the entry describes (generated rows from vendor OpenAPI specs, tool-catalog-generated-v1.json, may not repeat it); probes are what tools/tool-catalog-verify.ts runs, cheapest first within a spend budget; verification is the latest verdict (unverified, verified, drifted, retired). Nothing here comes from another catalog. The control plane seeds its store from this file without overwriting curated edits. Read by ryu_gw_contracts::tool_catalog and @ryuhq/protocol/tool-catalog.",
  "entries": [
